            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4">
          <div class="workflow-card p-4 h-100">
            <h3 class="h5 mb-3">Role-Based Access Control</h3>
            <p class="mb-0">
              Agents only access data and tools appropriate to their scope. Customer service agents can't touch financial data; support agents can't modify pricing.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4">
          <div class="workflow-card p-4 h-100">
            <h3 class="h5 mb-3">Real-Time Monitoring</h3>
            <p class="mb-0">
