            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4">
          <div class="workflow-card p-4 h-100">
            <h3 class="h5 mb-3">PII/PHI Protection</h3>
            <p class="mb-0">
              Encryption at rest and in transit, automatic redaction of sensitive information, and data minimization ensure safe handling of personal and health data.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4">
          <div class="workflow-card p-4 h-100">
            <h3 class="h5 mb-3">Compliance Frameworks</h3>
            <p class="mb-0">
